{"strongs": "H0724", "word": "אֲרוּכָה", "translit": "a.ru.khah", "root": "ארה", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "healing of a wound, restoration", "definition": "אֲרוּכָה noun feminine healing of a wound, restoration (properly the new flesh that grows at the wounded spot, Arabic ; Fi JPh xiii. 114-6 , so Fl De on Isa 58:8 see also Di ) — ׳ א 2Chr 24:13 ; Neh 4:1 אֲרֻכָה Jer 30:17 ; Jer 33:6 construct אֲרֻכַת Jer 8:22 אֲרֻכָֽתְךָ Isa 58:8 — alwaysfig. \\ \\ a. healing, restoration of Israel Isa 58:8 , here with verb צָמַח , elsewhere with עָלָה ; Jer 8:22 (|| רָפָא ), with עָלָה Hiph`il, subject ׳ י , Jer 30:17 ; Jer 33:6 (|| id. ) \\ \\ b. restoration of walls of temple 2Chr 24:13 , of walls of Jerusalem (compare Fi above) Neh 4:1 (both with עלה ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB759')\">BDB759</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H724')\">H724</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB758')\">BDB758</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB760')\">BDB760</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֲרוּכָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>healing of a wound, restoration</highlightword> (properly the new flesh that grows at the wounded spot, Arabic <placeholder416/>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Fi')\">Fi<sup>JPh xiii. 114-6</sup></lookup>, so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Fl')\">Fl</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> on <ref ref=\"Isa 58:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"58\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"58\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,58,8)\">Isa 58:8</ref> see also <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>) — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 24:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,24,13)\">2Chr 24:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 4:1\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(16,4,1)\">Neh 4:1</ref> <bdbheb>אֲרֻכָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 30:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,30,17)\">Jer 30:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 33:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,33,6)\">Jer 33:6</ref> construct <bdbheb>אֲרֻכַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 8:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,22)\">Jer 8:22</ref> <bdbheb>אֲרֻכָֽתְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 58:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"58\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"58\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,58,8)\">Isa 58:8</ref> — alwaysfig. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>healing, restoration</highlight> of Israel <ref ref=\"Isa 58:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"58\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"58\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,58,8)\">Isa 58:8</ref>, here with verb <bdbheb>צָמַח</bdbheb>, elsewhere with <bdbheb>עָלָה</bdbheb>; <ref ref=\"Jer 8:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,22)\">Jer 8:22</ref> (|| <bdbheb>רָפָא</bdbheb>), with <bdbheb>עָלָה</bdbheb> Hiph`il, subject <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Jer 30:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,30,17)\">Jer 30:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 33:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,33,6)\">Jer 33:6</ref> (|| <highlight>id.</highlight>) <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>restoration</highlight> of walls of temple <ref ref=\"2Chr 24:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,24,13)\">2Chr 24:13</ref>, of walls of Jerusalem (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Fi')\">Fi</lookup> above) <ref ref=\"Neh 4:1\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(16,4,1)\">Neh 4:1</ref> (both with <bdbheb>עלה</bdbheb>). </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 58:8", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 58, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "2Chr 24:13", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 24, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Neh 4:1", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 4, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Jer 30:17", "book": "JER", "chapter": 30, "verse": 17}, {"raw